 '# menubar'
 ''
 'By default an "Edit" menu with two commands ("copy" & "paste") is added. You can amend or replace'
 'that, or specify an empty vector for no menubar at all. '
 ''
 'Any menubar definition is used to instantiate an instance of the `Menubar` class; see there for details.'
